## Section: Text Processing

To pass this room:
---------------------------------------------------------------------

- A broken printer is garbling messages.
- Only precisely formatted output will activate the decoder.
- Read the template and format the values exactly as specified.

## Tasks:

1. Read template.txt to see the format spec and values.
   >> hint: `cat template.txt`

2. Use printf to format the output exactly as specified.
   >> hint: `printf "%-10s | %05d | %s\n" "word" 42 "value"`

3. The last line of the correctly formatted output is the password.

>> Decrypt tip for next room:
   openssl enc -aes-256-cbc -d -a -pbkdf2 -in ../room_25/README -out ../room_25/README.txt -pass pass:PASSWORD

Good Luck !!!
